// திட்ட அலுவலகத் தொகுதிகளுக்கான சோதனைகள்
//
// __Run it like any other program:  etamil --vm nUlakam/qittam/aluvalakam_cOqaZY.qmz__
// __It exits non-zero if anything fails, so it works as a CI step.__
//
// __Rescheduling, change requests into tasks, scope and features, the portfolio,__
// __lifecycle readiness and document contexts. Every date below was worked out by__
// __hand on a Monday-to-Friday calendar; today is Wednesday 7 October 2026 for the__
// __schedule and 28 September for the status report.__

